- WHO IS THAT?

689
00:46:42,594 --> 00:46:44,429
FOR FUCK’S SAKE, BOBBY.
BOBBY.

690
00:46:44,471 --> 00:46:47,557
BOBBY, GET ME OUT OF HERE.
BOBBY, HELP ME.

691
00:46:47,599 --> 00:46:49,934
- IS CALE HERE?
- WHO THE FUCK KNOWS?

692
00:46:49,976 --> 00:46:52,854
GET THIS OFF OF ME, BOBBY!
GET THIS OFF OF ME!

693
00:46:54,356 --> 00:46:56,524
( screaming)

694
00:46:57,942 --> 00:47:01,154
Hello, Bobby.
That feeling running

695
00:47:01,196 --> 00:47:03,615
<i>through your body is fear--</i>

696
00:47:03,656 --> 00:47:05,325
the fear of not knowing

697
00:47:05,367 --> 00:47:07,869
if you have what it takes
to survive.

698
00:47:07,911 --> 00:47:09,662
Before you is your lawyer

699
00:47:09,704 --> 00:47:11,498
<i>who swore an oath</i>
<i>of ethics,</i>

700
00:47:11,539 --> 00:47:14,376
<i>but chose to see no evil</i>

701
00:47:14,417 --> 00:47:16,503
<i>in order</i>
<i>to benefit herself.</i>

702
00:47:16,544 --> 00:47:19,047
<i>Once her device begins</i>
<i>to rotate,</i>

703
00:47:19,089 --> 00:47:21,883
<i>it will pierce her eyes</i>
<i>and mouth if you don’t delay</i>

704
00:47:21,925 --> 00:47:25,011
<i>its movement</i>
<i>for at least 30 seconds.</i>

705
00:47:25,053 --> 00:47:26,638
To do this,

706
00:47:26,680 --> 00:47:29,391
<i>you must step</i>
<i>into the other machine</i>

707
00:47:29,432 --> 00:47:32,644
<i>and lift the bars</i>
<i>to the highest position</i>
<i>long enough</i>

708
00:47:32,686 --> 00:47:36,064
<i>to close the circuit,</i>
<i>slowing down her device.</i>

709
00:47:36,106 --> 00:47:38,942
<i>If you do nothing,</i>
<i>she will wind to her death</i>

710
00:47:38,983 --> 00:47:40,902
<i>before the clock runs out.</i>

711
00:47:40,944 --> 00:47:43,196
Do you have what it takes
to help her?

712
00:47:43,238 --> 00:47:44,656
<i>Make your choice.</i>

713
00:47:44,698 --> 00:47:48,410
BOBBY, PLEASE!
BOBBY, PLEASE GET ME OUT!

714
00:47:48,451 --> 00:47:50,995
GET ME THE FUCK--
( screaming )

715
00:47:51,037 --> 00:47:53,498
