716
00:47:53,540 --> 00:47:56,501
NO NO!
BOBBY, PLEASE!

717
00:47:56,543 --> 00:47:58,586
PLEASE, HELP ME!

718
00:48:00,380 --> 00:48:03,383
<i>OH GOD!</i>
<i>OH FUCK!</i>

719
00:48:03,425 --> 00:48:05,427
