HURRY!

720
00:48:05,468 --> 00:48:08,138
<i>COME ON, BOBBY, PLEASE!</i>

721
00:48:08,179 --> 00:48:11,349
HURRY!  COME ON!
BOBBY, COME ON!

722
00:48:11,391 --> 00:48:13,393
<i>HURRY!  PLEASE!</i>

723
00:48:13,435 --> 00:48:15,395
<i>PLEASE, HURRY!</i>

724
00:48:15,437 --> 00:48:18,356
( grunting )

725
00:48:22,402 --> 00:48:25,321
BOBBY, PLEASE, HURRY!
HURRY!

726
00:48:28,450 --> 00:48:29,951
