OH GOD, NO!

733
00:48:49,262 --> 00:48:51,514
<i>NO!  BOBBY!</i>

734
00:48:51,556 --> 00:48:55,226
<i>PLEASE, NO!</i>
<i>BOBBY, NO!</i>

735
00:48:55,268 --> 00:48:58,063
