766
00:51:22,457 --> 00:51:25,669
<i>Once again,</i>
<i>we’re at a moral crossroad.</i>

767
00:51:25,710 --> 00:51:28,797
<i>I don’t blame you</i>
<i>for not giving me Jill Tuck.</i>

768
00:51:28,838 --> 00:51:31,383
But you shouldn’t let
an old grudge cloud
your judgment.

769
00:51:31,424 --> 00:51:34,636
<i>Look to where</i>
<i>you’re being led.</i>

770
00:51:34,678 --> 00:51:36,429
