<i>WHERE JOYCE IS?</i>

783
00:52:37,991 --> 00:52:39,701
I’M ABOUT TO LOSE MY SHIT!

784
00:52:39,743 --> 00:52:41,453
DO I KNOW WHERE JOYCE IS?
I’M FUCKING BLIND, MAN.

785
00:52:41,494 --> 00:52:43,913
OKAY, CALE.
CALE, DO NOT MOVE.

786
00:52:43,955 --> 00:52:45,999
<i>I GOT THIS THING</i>
<i>AROUND MY FUCKING NECK.</i>
<i>I CAN’T FUCKING BREATHE.</i>

787
00:52:46,041 --> 00:52:48,293
DON’T FUCKING MOVE.
WE’RE NOT ON THE GROUND FLOOR.

788
00:52:48,335 --> 00:52:51,463
A LOT OF THIS FLOOR IS MISSING.
JUST DON’T MOVE, OKAY?

789
00:52:51,504 --> 00:52:54,466
FUCK.
YOU GOTTA HELP ME.

790
00:52:54,507 --> 00:52:56,634
GET ME FUCKING DOWN, BOBBY!
FUCK!  OH, FUCK ME!

791
00:52:56,676 --> 00:52:59,471
CALE, THERE’S A TAPE.

792
00:52:59,512 --> 00:53:01,765
- WHAT FUCKING TAPE?
- <i>THERE’S A TAPE.</i>

793
00:53:01,806 --> 00:53:03,558
SHUT UP.
I’M GONNA PLAY THE TAPE.

794
00:53:05,268 --> 00:53:06,686
