795
00:53:06,728 --> 00:53:08,605
Jigsaw:
<i>Hello, Bobby.</i>

796
00:53:08,646 --> 00:53:11,941
<i>Across from you</i>
<i>is your closest friend.</i>

797
00:53:11,983 --> 00:53:14,527
<i>He knows all your sins,</i>

798
00:53:14,569 --> 00:53:17,655
<i>yet he acts as</i>
<i>though he hears no evil.</i>

799
00:53:17,697 --> 00:53:20,241
<i>Today, what he hears</i>

800
00:53:20,283 --> 00:53:23,286
<i>will be the difference</i>
<i>between life and death.</i>

801
00:53:23,328 --> 00:53:26,706
<i>Bobby, you must help</i>
<i>Cale walk over the planks</i>

802
00:53:26,748 --> 00:53:29,000
<i>and get as close</i>
<i>to you as possible.</i>

803
00:53:29,042 --> 00:53:33,380
<i>Find your own way across</i>
<i>the beams to the key.</i>

804
00:53:33,421 --> 00:53:36,800
<i>You must get it to him over</i>
<i>the last span between you.</i>

805
00:53:36,841 --> 00:53:39,386
