<i>within 60 seconds,</i>

807
00:53:41,763 --> 00:53:43,890
<i>a winch will be engaged</i>

808
00:53:43,932 --> 00:53:46,726
<i>and your secret will</i>
<i>be left hanging.</i>

809
00:53:46,768 --> 00:53:48,937
<i>Does Cale live or die, Bobby?</i>

810
00:53:48,978 --> 00:53:50,438
<i>The choice is yours.</i>

811
00:53:50,480 --> 00:53:53,483
BOBBY! OH GOD.

812
00:53:53,525 --> 00:53:56,486
CALE.
CALE, LISTEN TO ME.

813
