LISTEN TO ME.
SHUT THE FUCK UP AND YOU
LISTEN TO ME FOR ONCE.

814
00:53:59,781 --> 00:54:02,867
LISTEN, I’M GONNA WALK YOU
THROUGH THIS, OKAY, BUDDY?

815
00:54:02,909 --> 00:54:04,703
I’M BLIND.
YOU FUCKING COME TO ME.

816
00:54:04,744 --> 00:54:06,705
I’M GONNA TRY TO GET AS
CLOSE TO YOU AS I CAN, BUDDY.

817
00:54:06,746 --> 00:54:08,832
I’M FUCKING LISTENING TO YOU.
TALK ME FUCKING THROUGH THIS.

818
00:54:08,873 --> 00:54:10,917
I WANT YOU TO SHUFFLE
TO YOUR RIGHT.

819
00:54:10,959 --> 00:54:13,712
JUST SHUFFLE EXACTLY
TO YOUR RIGHT.

820
00:54:13,753 --> 00:54:16,631
YOU’RE GONNA FEEL A PLANK
AT YOUR FOOT.  YES YES.

821
00:54:16,673 --> 00:54:19,592
YES YES, PERFECT.
I NEED YOU TO HEAD OUT
ON THAT PLANK.

822
00:54:19,634 --> 00:54:21,886
