- <i>YES.</i>

823
00:54:21,928 --> 00:54:23,555
OKAY, I GOT IT.
I GOT IT.  I GOT IT!

824
00:54:23,596 --> 00:54:27,350
OH, FUCK THIS.

825
00:54:27,392 --> 00:54:29,644
OKAY, CALE,
I’M ON THE WAY.

826
00:54:29,686 --> 00:54:31,980
OH FUCK.  OH FUCK.
OKAY, ALL RIGHT.

827
00:54:32,022 --> 00:54:34,524
NOW THERE’S GONNA BE A PLANK
IN FRONT OF YOU.

828
00:54:34,566 --> 00:54:37,527
- OKAY.
- <i>YOU’RE GONNA GO ABOUT</i>
<i>10° TO YOUR RIGHT.</i>

829
00:54:37,569 --> 00:54:39,446
<i>I GOT IT.</i>
<i>I GOT IT.</i>

830
00:54:39,487 --> 00:54:41,781
- COME ON, KEEP
FUCKING TALKING TO ME.
- OKAY, CALE.

831
00:54:41,823 --> 00:54:44,034
- FEEL WHERE THE PLANK--
- <i>I GOT IT.</i>

832
00:54:44,075 --> 00:54:46,411
OKAY.

833
00:54:46,453 --> 00:54:49,122
OH GOD!
WHAT THE FUCK WAS
THAT, MAN?

834
00:54:49,164 --> 00:54:51,708
IT’S OKAY, CALE.
IT WAS A BOTTLE.
IT WAS A BOTTLE.

835
00:54:51,750 --> 00:54:54,461
- WHAT THE FUCK WAS THAT?
- IT’S OKAY.  IT WAS A BOTTLE.

836
00:54:54,502 --> 00:54:56,880
