838
00:55:01,009 --> 00:55:04,429
YOU GOT IT.
NOW YOU’RE GONNA
FEEL A SECOND PLANK.

839
00:55:04,471 --> 00:55:07,432
- <i>YOU’LL FEEL IT</i>
<i>WITH YOUR FOOT.</i>
- I GOT IT.

840
00:55:07,474 --> 00:55:09,517
FEEL IT WITH YOUR FOOT.

841
00:55:11,644 --> 00:55:13,480
<i>GET ME OUT OF THIS</i>
<i>FUCKING THING, BOBBY.</i>

842
00:55:13,521 --> 00:55:14,731
STEP UP ONTO THE PLANK.

843
00:55:17,150 --> 00:55:19,527
OH FUCK.
OH GOD.

844
00:55:19,569 --> 00:55:20,820
RELAX.
YOU’RE OKAY.

845
00:55:24,824 --> 00:55:27,369
NO!  NO!

846
00:55:27,410 --> 00:55:28,703
CALE, HANG ON.
CALE.

847
00:55:32,040 --> 00:55:33,500
<i>OH FUCK.</i>
<i>OH FUCK.</i>

848
00:55:33,541 --> 00:55:36,670
( whimpering )

849
00:55:36,711 --> 00:55:39,381
<i>OH FUCK.</i>
<i>OH FUCK.</i>

850
00:55:52,686 --> 00:55:54,562
<i>BOBBY.  BOBBY.</i>

851
00:56:02,862 --> 00:56:03,905
