00:58:28,216 --> 00:58:29,801
YOU OWE ME.

886
00:58:33,763 --> 00:58:35,765
Rogers:
<i>WHAT HAPPENED?</i>

887
00:58:37,851 --> 00:58:40,270
HE GOT A PROMOTION
IS WHAT HAPPENED.

888
00:58:40,311 --> 00:58:43,565
AND I GOT PUT ON AN ISLAND.

889
00:58:43,606 --> 00:58:46,151
A YEAR LATER,
I TRANSFERRED TO I.A.,
BUSTED THREE OF HIS GUYS.

890
00:58:46,192 --> 00:58:50,030
HE SWORE HE’D GET ME BACK
AND HERE WE ARE.

891
00:58:50,071 --> 00:58:53,199
THIS PLACE WAS CALLED
CROSSROADS MANUFACTURING

892
00:58:53,241 --> 00:58:55,660
BEFORE IT CLOSED.

893
00:58:55,702 --> 00:58:58,830
"LOOK BEYOND
THE CROSSROADS...

894
00:59:00,373 --> 00:59:02,751
TO THE CLEAR DAWN."

895
00:59:02,792 --> 00:59:04,919
I DON’T FOLLOW YOU.

896
00:59:04,961 --> 00:59:08,673
THE MAN HE KILLED WAS
RELEASED FROM CLEAR DAWN
PSYCHIATRIC HOSPITAL

897
00:59:08,715 --> 00:59:10,842
WHEN THE STATE
SHUT IT DOWN.

898
00:59:10,884 --> 00:59:12,594
THAT BUILDING’S BEEN
ABANDONED FOR YEARS.

899
00:59:12,635 --> 00:59:15,305
THAT’S WHERE THE GAME
IS BEING PLAYED.

900
00:59:15,347 --> 00:59:18,266
ALL RIGHT, YOU GET BACK,
YOU STAY WITH JILL TUCK.

901
00:59:18,308 --> 00:59:20,935
DON’T LET HER OUT
OF YOUR SIGHT.

902
00:59:39,329 --> 00:59:42,874
- Bobby.
- JOYCE?

903
00:59:42,916 --> 00:59:45,293
<i>Bobby.  Bobby.</i>

904
00:59:45,335 --> 00:59:47,212
Bobby, I’m here.

905
00:59:47,253 --> 00:59:49,130
JOYCE.

906
00:59:49,172 --> 00:59:50,757
Bobby, can you hear me?

907
00:59:50,799 --> 00:59:52,425
JOYCE, I CAN HEAR YOU.
I CAN SEE YOU.

908
00:59:52,467 --> 00:59:53,927
Bobby, I can
see you too.

909
00:59:53,968 --> 00:59:56,805
YES, BABY.

910
00:59:56,846 --> 00:59:59,391
- GET ME OUT OF HERE.
- Baby, I’m on my way.

911
00:59:59,432 --> 01:00:01,768
WHO’S DOING THIS?
WHY?

912
01:00:01,810 --> 01:00:04,270
- Why is this happening?
- PLEASE, BABY, I’M ON THE WAY.

913
01:00:04,312 --> 01:00:07,941
- JUST HANG ON, OKAY?
- HURRY.  PLEASE HURRY.

914
01:00:07,982 --> 01:00:10,777
THERE’S GOT TO BE A TAPE.

915
01:00:10,819 --> 01:00:13,780
Hello, Bobby.

916
01:00:13,822 --> 01:00:16,866
Before you is the door
that leads to your wife.

917
01:00:16,908 --> 01:00:20,286
However, you must
first make a choice.

918
01:00:20,328 --> 01:00:23,790
As you may have guessed,
your decision will be
as difficult

919
01:00:23,832 --> 01:00:25,834
<i>as pulling teeth.</i>

920
01:00:25,875 --> 01:00:28,003
<i>The lock before you</i>

921
01:00:28,044 --> 01:00:30,714
requires a four-digit
combination to open.

922
01:00:30,755 --> 01:00:33,800
<i>However, if it is</i>
<i>access you seek,</i>

923
01:00:33,842 --> 01:00:35,802
<i>then a true sacrifice</i>

924
01:00:35,844 --> 01:00:37,178
<i>will have to be made.</i>

925
01:00:38,805 --> 01:00:40,724
Watch and learn, Bobby.

926
01:00:45,812 --> 01:00:47,897
<i>The necessary numbers</i>
<i>have been etched</i>

927
01:00:47,939 --> 01:00:50,817
<i>onto two</i>
<i>of your teeth.</i>

928
01:00:50,859 --> 01:00:53,069
<i>Look to the chart</i>
<i>as a reference</i>

929
01:00:53,111 --> 01:00:56,031
<i>for which teeth to pull</i>
<i>and in which order</i>

930
01:00:56,072 --> 01:00:58,408
<i>to enter the digits.</i>

931
01:00:58,450 --> 01:01:01,161
<i>Time is ticking down.</i>

932
01:01:01,202 --> 01:01:02,996
You must make
your decision quickly.

933
01:01:08,084 --> 01:01:10,378
Bobby!

934
01:01:10,420 --> 01:01:13,757
I DON’T WANT YOU
TO SEE THIS, BABY, OKAY?

935
01:01:13,798 --> 01:01:15,008
OH MY GOD.

936
01:01:16,885 --> 01:01:20,055
No.
( crying )

937
01:01:21,306 --> 01:01:23,892
No.

938
01:01:23,933 --> 01:01:26,227
LEFT SIDE CLEAR.

939
01:01:26,269 --> 01:01:27,479
CLEAR.

940
01:01:28,938 --> 01:01:30,357
- CLEAR.
- CLEAR.

941
01:01:30,398 --> 01:01:33,401
TAKE YOUR POSITIONS.

942
01:01:33,443 --> 01:01:35,445
Gibson:
<i>THE GAME’S STILL ON.</i>

943
01:01:35,487 --> 01:01:37,906
- ( cracking )
- ( grunting )

944
01:01:44,954 --> 01:01:48,291
- LET’S GO.
- MOVE TO THE SECOND LEVEL.

945
01:01:54,964 --> 01:01:57,217
- CLEAR.
- CLEAR.

946
01:01:57,258 --> 01:01:58,927
CLEAR.

947
01:01:58,968 --> 01:02:00,136
GO.

948
01:02:04,099 --> 01:02:05,767
( crunches )

949
01:02:10,814 --> 01:02:12,440
( groaning )

950
01:02:16,152 --> 01:02:18,071
- CLEAR UP.
- ALL CLEAR.

951
01:02:18,113 --> 01:02:20,532
MOVE MOVE.

952
01:02:20,573 --> 01:02:23,785
- MOVING IN.
- MOVING IN.

953
01:02:23,827 --> 01:02:26,287
- CLEAR.
- WE’RE CLEAR.

954
01:02:29,958 --> 01:02:31,835
( beeps )

955
01:02:31,876 --> 01:02:33,962
<i>( cell phone rings )</i>

956
01:02:34,004 --> 01:02:36,297
Officer:
<i>BLOCK IT OFF.</i>

957
01:02:36,339 --> 01:02:38,508
- <i>What?</i>
- I FOUND WHERE
THAT MPEG CAME FROM.

958
01:02:38,550 --> 01:02:42,262
- <i>Where?</i>
- A BUSINESS CALLED PETE’S
AUTO BODY ON 58th STREET.

959
01:02:42,303 --> 01:02:44,806
- <i>The junkyard.</i>
- THE LOCATION OF THE CAR TRAP.

960
01:02:44,848 --> 01:02:46,141
YEAH, THAT’S CORRECT.

961
01:02:49,227 --> 01:02:52,147
- OKAY, YOU GUYS KEEP MOVING.
- WHERE ARE YOU GOING?

962
01:02:52,188 --> 01:02:55,900
- TO GET HOFFMAN.
- OKAY, LET’S MOVE IT.

963
01:02:57,318 --> 01:02:59,320
<i>( cell phone rings )</i>

964
01:03:01,573 --> 01:03:03,575
ROGERS.

965
01:03:07,495 --> 01:03:09,414
- YEAH.
- <i>( beeps )</i>

966
01:03:09,456 --> 01:03:12,959
WHAT?
WHAT HAPPENED?

967
01:03:13,001 --> 01:03:15,003
GIBSON’S GOT
HOFFMAN’S LOCATION.

968
01:03:16,504 --> 01:03:18,381
THE GAME ISN’T OVER.

969
01:03:20,216 --> 01:03:23,011
( grunting )

970
01:03:27,349 --> 01:03:29,225
( crunches )

971
01:03:32,270 --> 01:03:34,189
ANOTHER BODY.

972
01:03:35,565 --> 01:03:38,109
- <i>( Bobby screaming )</i>
- HOLD.

973
01:03:41,363 --> 01:03:43,031
WE GOT A LIVE ONE.

974
01:03:59,673 --> 01:04:03,051
CAN’T CROSS HERE.
LET’S GO.

975
01:04:36,960 --> 01:04:38,670
<i>( beeps )</i>

976
01:04:44,426 --> 01:04:47,971
<i>( siren wailing )</i>

977
01:04:48,013 --> 01:04:51,349
HEY, GO GET YOUR SHOTGUNS.
YOU COME FOLLOW ME.

978
