YOUR HANDS IN THE AIR.

981
01:05:44,652 --> 01:05:47,572
- JOYCE.
- BOBBY.

982
01:05:47,614 --> 01:05:50,533
BOBBY,
I KNEW YOU’D MAKE IT.

983
01:05:51,743 --> 01:05:54,454
- I KNEW YOU’D FIND ME.
- I AM SO SORRY.

984
01:05:54,496 --> 01:05:58,166
