986
01:06:00,335 --> 01:06:03,296
- ( electricity crackles )
- ( screams )

987
01:06:03,338 --> 01:06:06,299
- BOBBY.  OH MY GOD.
- ( whimpering )

988
01:06:06,341 --> 01:06:08,218
