- ( static hisses )

989
01:06:08,259 --> 01:06:10,470
( gasps )

990
01:06:10,512 --> 01:06:12,722
Hello, Bobby.

991
01:06:12,764 --> 01:06:15,433
<i>You have almost completed</i>
<i>your rebirth.</i>

992
01:06:15,475 --> 01:06:17,519
<i>However, your final task</i>

993
01:06:17,560 --> 01:06:20,105
will be your
most difficult.

994
01:06:20,146 --> 01:06:23,400
<i>The woman before you</i>
<i>symbolizes your success.</i>

995
01:06:23,441 --> 01:06:25,110
<i>She is your trophy.</i>

996
01:06:25,151 --> 01:06:27,654
<i>And she has seen the good</i>
<i>in your message,</i>

997
01:06:27,696 --> 01:06:31,324
- despite its
dishonest beginnings.
- WHAT’S HE TALKING ABOUT?

998
01:06:31,366 --> 01:06:33,368
<i>Today, we will see</i>

999
01:06:33,410 --> 01:06:36,538
- if you can truly earn
her love.
- BOBBY.

1000
01:06:36,579 --> 01:06:38,832
To prove your status

1001
01:06:38,873 --> 01:06:41,793
as a survivor,
you must overcome a game

1002
01:06:41,835 --> 01:06:45,422
that should be
all too familiar.

1003
01:06:45,463 --> 01:06:48,341
- NO.
- <i>You supposedly survived</i>
<i>it once already</i>

1004
01:06:48,383 --> 01:06:51,803
so it should be easy
to survive once again.

1005
01:06:51,845 --> 01:06:54,764
<i>Pierce the hooks</i>
<i>through your chest muscles,</i>

1006
01:06:54,806 --> 01:06:56,558
<i>and the game</i>
<i>will begin.</i>

1007
01:06:56,599 --> 01:06:59,060
<i>In order to free yourself</i>
<i>and your wife,</i>

1008
01:06:59,102 --> 01:07:01,688
<i>you must hoist yourself</i>
<i>with these chains</i>

1009
01:07:01,730 --> 01:07:05,316
<i>and connect</i>
<i>the extension cords above you</i>

1010
01:07:05,358 --> 01:07:08,111
<i>before the clock expires.</i>

1011
01:07:09,904 --> 01:07:13,658
Both hands will be needed
to complete this task.

1012
01:07:13,700 --> 01:07:15,785
But that should be simple.

1013
01:07:15,827 --> 01:07:18,705
<i>For, as you claim</i>
<i>to understand,</i>

1014
01:07:18,747 --> 01:07:22,459
<i>the pectoral muscles can</i>
<i>easily support your weight.</i>

1015
01:07:22,500 --> 01:07:24,627
<i>So I ask you, Bobby,</i>

1016
01:07:24,669 --> 01:07:27,797
<i>when you embrace every day</i>
<i>as if it is your last,</i>

1017
01:07:27,839 --> 01:07:30,300
<i>will it be with your wife?</i>

1018
01:07:30,342 --> 01:07:33,553
Make your choice.

1019
01:07:33,595 --> 01:07:36,514
WHAT’S HE TALKING ABOUT?

1020
01:07:36,556 --> 01:07:39,309
BABY, I’M SO SORRY.

1021
01:07:39,351 --> 01:07:40,810
I LIED.

1022
01:07:43,188 --> 01:07:44,814
I WAS NEVER IN A TRAP.

1023
01:07:50,779 --> 01:07:53,740
CLEAR.

1024
01:08:04,459 --> 01:08:07,337
<i>( insects buzzing )</i>

1025
01:08:16,471 --> 01:08:18,682
HOW COULD YOU LET ME
BELIEVE THAT?

1026
01:08:18,723 --> 01:08:21,601
I’M GONNA MAKE THIS RIGHT.

1027
01:08:21,643 --> 01:08:24,813
YOU DON’T DESERVE
TO BE THERE.

1028
01:08:26,648 --> 01:08:28,274
I’M YOUR WIFE.

1029
01:08:28,316 --> 01:08:30,652
HOW COULD YOU LIE TO ME?

1030
01:08:30,694 --> 01:08:32,362
( crying )

1031
01:08:39,661 --> 01:08:42,622
HEY, I KNOW THAT
FROM SOMEWHERE.

1032
01:08:42,664 --> 01:08:44,833
MAKE YOUR CHOICE.
CLOCK’S TICKING.

1033
01:08:55,218 --> 01:08:58,430
BAG THE OTHER BODIES.
GET THEM BACK TO THE CORONER’S
OFFICE RIGHT AWAY.

1034
01:08:59,639 --> 01:09:01,891
Officer:
<i>WHAT IS THIS, SIR?</i>

1035
01:09:01,933 --> 01:09:05,729
HOFFMAN TAPPED INTO
THE STATION’S SECURITY SYSTEM.

1036
01:09:05,770 --> 01:09:07,647
HE’S BEEN WATCHING
US THE WHOLE TIME.

1037
01:09:07,689 --> 01:09:10,442
- ( beeps )
- ( explosion )

1038
01:09:35,717 --> 01:09:38,887
Gibson:
<i>OH MY GOD.</i>

1039
01:09:41,014 --> 01:09:43,558
( cell phone beeps )

1040
01:09:43,600 --> 01:09:46,519
- ( phone rings )
- THIS IS PALMER.

1041
01:09:46,561 --> 01:09:48,688
LISTEN, YOU GET EVERY
AVAILABLE OFFICER BACK
TO THE STATION.

1042
01:09:48,730 --> 01:09:51,358
- I’M SORRY, SIR?
- RIGHT NOW.

1043
01:09:51,399 --> 01:09:52,233
<i>( rattling )</i>

1044
01:09:52,275 --> 01:09:53,234
SIR.

1045
01:10:10,585 --> 01:10:13,421
GIBSON, ARE YOU STILL THERE?
GIBSON.

1046
01:10:25,517 --> 01:10:28,436
( gagging )

1047
01:10:46,454 --> 01:10:47,956
HEY, WHAT--?

1048
01:11:05,473 --> 01:11:07,934
- DOOR’S LOCKED!
- WE’RE LOCKED IN!

1049
01:11:07,976 --> 01:11:10,437
( gas hissing )

1050
01:11:10,478 --> 01:11:12,522
GAS!  GAS!

1051
01:11:12,564 --> 01:11:13,857
LOOK FOR AN EXIT.

1052
01:11:18,820 --> 01:11:21,865
( coughing )

1053
01:11:34,544 --> 01:11:36,796
I LOVE YOU, JOYCE.

1054
01:11:38,840 --> 01:11:40,675
I NEVER LIED ABOUT THAT.

1055
01:11:40,717 --> 01:11:43,636
I LOVE YOU.

1056
01:11:43,678 --> 01:11:45,638
<i>BOBBY, I LOVE YOU.</i>

1057
01:11:49,601 --> 01:11:52,562
- ( screaming )
- NO!  OH MY GOD.

1058
01:11:52,604 --> 01:11:53,980
( gasping )

1059
01:11:54,022 --> 01:11:55,690
NO.

1060
01:12:00,779 --> 01:12:01,905
NO.

1061
01:12:06,201 --> 01:12:08,745
GIBSON.

1062
01:12:11,414 --> 01:12:13,792
( muffled screaming )

1063
01:12:13,833 --> 01:12:14,876
<i>( knife clatters )</i>

1064
01:12:18,463 --> 01:12:19,881
( neck cracks )

1065
01:12:22,801 --> 01:12:24,636
YOU CAN DO IT.
YOU CAN DO IT.

1066
01:12:28,473 --> 01:12:29,974
( screaming )

1067
01:12:30,016 --> 01:12:31,935
OH MY GOD.

1068
01:12:36,815 --> 01:12:38,817
BOBBY, I LOVE YOU.

1069
01:12:55,041 --> 01:12:56,167
YOU CAN DO IT.

1070
01:12:59,587 --> 01:13:03,550
HANG ON.  HANG ON.
HANG ON.

1071
01:13:03,591 --> 01:13:06,177
PULL.  PULL, BOBBY.
I KNOW YOU CAN DO IT.

1072
01:13:06,219 --> 01:13:08,888
<i>PULL.</i>

1073
01:13:08,930 --> 01:13:12,100
OH MY GOD.
YOU CAN DO IT.

1074
01:13:12,142 --> 01:13:14,644
BOBBY, YOU CAN DO IT.
OH MY GOD.

1075
01:13:14,686 --> 01:13:16,896
<i>BOBBY!</i>

1076
01:13:16,938 --> 01:13:18,440
PULL!

1077
01:13:22,485 --> 01:13:23,987
<i>( knock on door )</i>

1078
01:13:35,832 --> 01:13:37,167
( bangs )

1079
01:13:42,797 --> 01:13:45,925
- WHAT WAS THAT?
- THAT’S IT, PULL.  PULL!

1080
01:13:47,886 --> 01:13:49,637
- PULL.
- <i>( grunting )</i>

1081
01:13:51,639 --> 01:13:53,975
HURRY!

1082
01:13:55,143 --> 01:13:57,979
PULL.
YOU’RE ALMOST THERE.

1083
01:14:00,565 --> 01:14:02,609
<i>FIGHT, BOBBY.</i>
<i>YOU CAN DO IT.</i>

1084
01:14:04,652 --> 01:14:05,612
SOMEONE’S OUT THERE.

1085
01:14:13,161 --> 01:14:15,789
OH MY GOD.
NO!

1086
01:14:15,830 --> 01:14:19,125
HELP ME!
HELP ME!

1087
01:14:19,167 --> 01:14:22,045
HELP ME!  NO!

1088
01:14:30,136 --> 01:14:32,180
I’VE BEEN LOOKING FOR YOU.

1089
01:14:32,222 --> 01:14:33,848
( panting )

1090
01:14:53,284 --> 01:14:54,953
( whimpers )

1091
01:14:54,994 --> 01:14:57,831
HOW DO I LOOK?

1092
01:14:57,872 --> 01:14:59,874
( grunts )

1093
01:15:03,211 --> 01:15:06,047
BITCH.

1094
01:15:06,089 --> 01:15:08,967
HELP ME!

1095
01:15:12,637 --> 01:15:15,765
BOBBY, PLEASE, REACH.

1096
01:15:15,807 --> 01:15:16,766
GO.

1097
01:15:17,976 --> 01:15:19,352
BOBBY, REACH.

1098
01:15:19,394 --> 01:15:21,730
<i>HURRY.</i>

1099
01:15:21,771 --> 01:15:23,898
REACH.
REACH!

1100
01:15:23,940 --> 01:15:25,316
<i>YOU CAN DO IT, BOBBY.</i>

1101
01:15:25,358 --> 01:15:28,028
( whimpering )

1102
01:15:39,372 --> 01:15:42,208
BOBBY, REACH.
REACH.

1103
01:15:42,250 --> 01:15:44,961
<i>ONE MORE.  REACH.</i>
<i>YOU CAN DO IT.  BOBBY!</i>

1104
01:15:45,003 --> 01:15:47,088
BOBBY, YOU CAN DO IT.

1105
01:15:47,130 --> 01:15:49,674
( screaming )

1106
01:15:52,427 --> 01:15:55,263
( screams )
BOBBY!

1107
01:16:47,982 --> 01:16:49,317
( groans )

1108
01:16:59,828 --> 01:17:00,995
NO!

1109
01:17:03,164 --> 01:17:04,416
BOBBY!

1110
01:17:08,962 --> 01:17:12,382
NO.  BOBBY!

1111
01:17:12,424 --> 01:17:14,342
JOYCE!

1112
01:17:15,885 --> 01:17:18,930
( screaming )
BOBBY!

1113
01:17:20,348 --> 01:17:22,934
