1114
01:17:22,976 --> 01:17:25,270
( screaming )

1115
01:17:27,272 --> 01:17:29,858
JOYCE!  JOYCE!

1116
01:17:29,899 --> 01:17:31,818
( electricity crackling )

1117
01:17:33,111 --> 01:17:35,947
- BOBBY!
- ( sobbing )

1118
01:17:45,165 --> 01:17:47,042
( shouts )

