1120
01:17:54,215 --> 01:17:56,843
- <i>( screaming )</i>
- ( gasping )

1121
01:17:56,885 --> 01:17:59,804
NO!  BOBBY!

1122
01:18:05,101 --> 01:18:06,144
JOYCE!

1123
01:18:08,063 --> 01:18:09,397
NO!

1124
01:18:21,826 --> 01:18:22,869
BOBBY!

1125
01:18:33,088 --> 01:18:34,881
JOYCE!

1126
01:18:36,925 --> 01:18:39,844
- ( sizzling )
- ( sobbing )

1127
01:19:20,552 --> 01:19:24,264
- ( clicks )
- ( ticking )

1128
01:19:24,305 --> 01:19:26,391
( whimpering )

1129
01:19:58,506 --> 01:20:00,925
GAME OVER.

1130
01:20:17,942 --> 01:20:19,944
TV Announcer:
<i>Over the last two hours,</i>

1131
01:20:19,986 --> 01:20:22,989
<i>it seems our entire city</i>
<i>has been shaken to its core.</i>

1132
01:20:23,031 --> 01:20:25,658
<i>In addition to the nine police</i>
<i>employees killed tonight,</i>

1133
01:20:25,700 --> 01:20:29,621
<i>Jill Tuck, the wife of</i>
<i>serial killer John Kramer,</i>
<i>has been found dead.</i>

1134
01:20:29,662 --> 01:20:32,582
- ( gas hissing )
- Citizens are being advised
to report any activity

1135
01:20:32,624 --> 01:20:35,168
even remotely suspicious
at this time

1136
01:20:35,210 --> 01:20:37,420
as blockades are being set up
at major intersections

1137
01:20:37,462 --> 01:20:39,923
within a 30-mile radius

1138
01:20:39,964 --> 01:20:43,218
surrounding what
will be considered
the largest attack

1139
01:20:43,259 --> 01:20:46,554
<i>on this city’s police</i>
<i>department in our history.</i>

1140
01:20:46,596 --> 01:20:49,974
<i>Any citizens with</i>
<i>information leading</i>
<i>to the apprehension...</i>

1141
01:21:13,373 --> 01:21:15,375
( gasps )

1142
01:21:23,216 --> 01:21:25,093
WHAT THE FUCK?

1143
01:21:42,360 --> 01:21:44,612
Jigsaw:
<i>Hello, Dr. Gordon.</i>

1144
01:21:44,654 --> 01:21:48,450
You are perhaps
my greatest asset.

1145
01:22:02,422 --> 01:22:06,134
CONGRATULATIONS, DR. GORDON.
YOU SURVIVED.

1146
01:22:09,304 --> 01:22:11,181
( gasping )

1147
01:22:20,231 --> 01:22:22,233
Jigsaw:
<i>Without you, my work</i>

1148
01:22:22,275 --> 01:22:24,235
<i>over the last few years</i>

1149
01:22:24,277 --> 01:22:26,446
<i>would not</i>
<i>have been possible.</i>

1150
01:22:31,451 --> 01:22:33,078
( screams )

1151
01:22:34,371 --> 01:22:36,289
JEFF’S WIFE,

1152
01:22:36,331 --> 01:22:38,333
DR. LYNN DENLON.

1153
01:22:42,420 --> 01:22:43,713
SHE’LL BE PERFECT.

1154
01:22:51,096 --> 01:22:54,307
MY EYES--
I CAN’T SEE!

1155
01:23:09,197 --> 01:23:11,324
Jigsaw:
<i>That having been said,</i>
<i>I have a request.</i>

1156
01:23:11,366 --> 01:23:13,159
Watch over Jill.

1157
01:23:13,201 --> 01:23:16,663
And should anything happen
to her,

1158
01:23:16,705 --> 01:23:20,500
I want you to act immediately
on my behalf.

1159
01:23:20,542 --> 01:23:22,252
<i>In return for that,</i>

1160
01:23:22,293 --> 01:23:25,046
<i>I will keep no more secrets</i>
<i>from you.</i>

1161
01:23:27,549 --> 01:23:30,760
<i>I’ve showed you</i>
<i>a lot of places.</i>

1162
01:23:30,802 --> 01:23:33,179
<i>But there is one</i>

1163
01:23:33,221 --> 01:23:35,682
<i>that will be, perhaps,</i>
<i>the most meaningful to you.</i>

1164
01:23:39,477 --> 01:23:42,522
( screams )

1165
01:23:59,289 --> 01:24:02,292
( grunts )

1166
01:24:09,924 --> 01:24:12,135
<i>( screaming )</i>

1167
01:24:15,263 --> 01:24:17,307
I DON’T THINK SO.

1168
01:24:28,860 --> 01:24:32,405
WHAT DO YOU THINK
YOU’RE DOING?

1169
01:24:32,447 --> 01:24:35,658
WHAT THE FUCK DO YOU
THINK YOU’RE DOING, HUH?

1170
01:24:44,459 --> 01:24:47,379
NO.

1171
01:24:47,420 --> 01:24:48,713
YOU CAN’T FUCKING
DO THIS TO ME.

1172
01:24:48,755 --> 01:24:51,675
FUCK YOU.
NO!

1173
01:24:51,716 --> 01:24:54,552
- GAME OVER.
- NO!

1174
01:24:59,307 --> 01:25:02,227
<i>( rock music playing )</i>

